  "description": "Webhook of the Lark content bot at /webhook/content-agent (event and card callback URL). Answers Lark's URL check and acknowledges at once. Button clicks: accepted only from the linked manager with the row's current token; records the decision as an event and tells the agent. Messages: re-read from the Lark API, the first sender is linked as manager, others are ignored; every message is saved as an event and handed to the agent.",
